      "sourceTextSha256": "9bd6b6294ebcaa351499cba666354835f18c2af10ac677fccb74a4ad87563c61",
      "text": "USD 5,576 per person, 4-star hotels, DBL; domestic flights cost an additional USD 1,590 NET.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw4mhbla-amanda",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The Word confirms USD 5,576 DBL and flights from USD 1,590 but omits the RU NET designation; translated from the assigned RU price note, preserving both amounts and NET without changing common tariffs."
      }
